# Contact form relay.
#
# Get a key in about a minute: go to https://web3forms.com, enter the address
# that should receive the enquiries (sales@tsoo13.co.bw), and they email you
# an access key. Paste it below into a file named .env.local and the form
# starts sending. Nothing else to configure and no server to run.
#
# This key is not a secret worth hiding — it only permits sending mail TO its
# owner. It is fine in a client bundle, which is why it is a VITE_ variable.
#
# Without it the form does not pretend: it shows the email and WhatsApp
# buttons instead of a submit that goes nowhere.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
